### Page 1 of 1

```text
May 12, 2023

Dear City Council,

Please consider this our request for an extension of our parked brewery and bar and grill licenses
for Westby Edge Brewing. We are very much hoping and needing to be open on June 1, 2023, but in the
event there is an issue, we want to request an extension in an abundance of caution. We are in the home
stretch of the project with just the finishes like paint touchups and putting together tables and chairs.
We have completed the structural, electrical, plumbing and HVAC for the building and we are currently
finishing the landscaping. Financially, it is crucial that we open our doors as soon as possible so we will
not delay the opening any longer than absolutely necessary. We are hopeful we will get our certificate of
occupancy on May 22 when we have scheduled inspections. Thank you for your consideration,

Misha Westby

Westby Edge Brewing
```
